<title>UK: Brake Bros yr profits off 10.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Brake Bros yr profits off 10.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		30.8		   vs  34.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  7.3		   vs   6.8</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 10.2		   vs   9.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     24.1		   vs  27.1</p>
<p> Turnover		  650.7		   vs 466.3</p>
<p>NOTE - The 10.9 percent drop in pretax profit was largely attributable to a 5.2 million stg loss at Puritan Maid which was acquired in November 1995.</p>
<p>Full company name of food supplier - Brake Bros Plc</p>
</text>
